hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1546","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, Ibn Abi Adiy told us, on the authority of Saeed, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Anas, that the Prophet of God, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him He said: “Complete the front row, and if there is a deficiency, let it be in the back.”"
"1547","Abu Bakr bin Ishaq Al-Sana'ani told us, Abu Asim told us, on the authority of Shu'bah, similar to it. He said: “Complete the first and second rows, and if there is a defect, let it be in the third.”"
